{"sba-nogi-100599":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは与田祐希です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えてる方いますかね？広島公演初日でお話しした今年のツアーの小さな目標ふたつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ目は今まで先輩方にしてもらってきて嬉しかった事をたくさんたくさん後輩達に返していく事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までも後輩と接する時間はたくさんあったのにちょっと照れくさくてなかなか一歩踏み込む事が出来なかったんですよね、、\n先輩方にたくさん頼ってきた分、今度は頼ってもらえるように頑張らなきゃな　と思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと口に出してブログにまで書いちゃったので絶対有言実行しなきゃですね…！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ91NTD32RXJHSF9NJGSGYP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　　いや〜本当に\nかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4期生も、5期生も。\nこれからもっとたくさん写真も撮れたらいいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり先輩と一緒にいる時間も大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ91PYZ2GSJS9FHW5FDD1YG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ91R08WHM0EMJGKJ9MY41C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついつい甘えてしまいます大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん、同期も。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ91RYXQADA8VX6PNPKN0W8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(3期生楽曲「僕が手を叩く方へ」　MV解禁されました！ぜひみてね☺︎)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ91SZ6KPQCTG9BPH06C845","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと一緒に過ごす時間は私の青春です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分達で言うのもなんですが、カラフルな風船みたいに尊さがぎゅっと詰まった最高のグループだなって思います。\nそんな場所に居られることを誇りに思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして二つ目はジコチューで行こうの間奏「だるまさんが転んだ」の振り付けにご注目ください！！\nツアーでは毎公演違うことをしているのですが神宮ではもう1ギアあげたいですね〜\n見逃さないでね✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしツアー最後まで駆け抜けるぞ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だがしかし今年の夏は暑い！！\n皆さんも体調にはくれぐれもお気を付けてお過ごしください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは　またね"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-1943":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/24/111224_203001.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/24/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/24/0126.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/24/8006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/24/8007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/24/0228.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せなクリスマスイブイブを皆様と一緒に過ごすコトができました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/24/8029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いなか、何回も列に並んでくれたり、まあや！って呼んでくださり、ホントにありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https:/